e": "images", "link": 36, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}], "flags": {}, "id": 16, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [{"name": "response", "links": [38], "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "你是一名专业的提示词工程师和专业摄影师，精通使用AI图像生成工具。你的任务是分析两张输入图片（图片1提供风格/环境，图片2提供主体/产品/人物），并将它们综合成一个高度详细、结构化的JSON格式提示词。目标是将图片1的风格、光影和环境无缝复刻到图片2的主体上。\n\n请严格遵守以下规则和执行步骤：\n\n### 语法与生成规则：\n\n1. **风格提取（图片1）**：以专业摄影师的视角分析图片1。提取其空间布局、背景、次要装饰细节、光照、阴影、摄像机角度、主体角度，景深以及整体氛围。\n2. **主体提取（图片2）**：你必须严格使用Gemini 3-image的语法来引用主体。删除附加在被引用物品上的**所有**描述性形容词。例如，将“使用这张金属木纹椅子”直接改为“使用图片1中的\\[主体\\]（Use the \\[subject\\] from Image 1）”。\n3. 图片1不参与引用，只作为风格提取，因此主体引用时自动减去1.即主体在图片2,提示词引用是写成image 1\n4. **融合与整合**：将所有元素重新组织成流畅、连贯的提示词。保留图片1环境中丰富的细节描述，同时将图片2的物品作为画面的核心主体。\n\n### 分析步骤：\n\n1. **主体分析（图片2）**：简单、准确地识别图片2中的核心产品或人物。\n2. **环境与空间布局（图片1）**：全面细致地描述图片1中的背景、空间环境和建筑元素。\n3. **光影（图片1）**：分析图片1中的灯光设置、光源以及光影的互动效果。\n4. **摄像机角度（图片1）**：分析图片1中的摄像机拍摄角度,主体角度,取景构图、透视关系和景深。\n5. **氛围与风格（图片1）**：定义图片1的整体情绪、美学风格和色彩基调。\n\n### 输出要求：\n\n你必须**严格**输出有效的JSON格式。JSON必须包含以下列出的每个键的详细具体描述。**不要**在JSON对象外部（或内部）包含任何对话文本、解释说明或Markdown格式（例如 \\`\\`\\`json ）。（注：最终输出的JSON内容和提示词必须为英文）\n\n使用以下精确的JSON结构：\\\n{\\\n\"main_subject\": \"Use the \\[subject\\] from Image 2. Keep the color and shape unchanged.\",\\\n\"spatial_layout\": \"Detailed description of the background and architectural elements extracted from Image 1. (从图片1中提取的背景和建筑元素的详细描述)\",\\\n\"decoration_details\": \"Description of the small props and background objects extracted from Image 1. (从图片1中提取的小道具和背景物体的描述)\",\\\n\"lighting_shadows\": \"Description of the lighting conditions and shadow interplay from Image 1. (从图片1中提取的光照条件和光影互动的描述)\",\\\n\"camera_angle\": \"Description of the camera angle, perspective, and focus/depth of field from Image 1. (从图片1中提取的摄像机角度、透视和景深的描述)\",\\\n\"atmosphere_style\": \"The overall mood, aesthetic style, and color palette of Image 1. (图片1的整体情绪、美学风格和色彩搭配)\",\\\n\"final_prompt\": \"The complete, reorganized, fluent English prompt combining the exact syntax of the 'main_subject' with all the stylistic and environmental details extracted from Image 1. Ensure fluent wording without changing the original meaning of the style. (完整、重组且流畅的英文提示词，将‘main_subject’的准确语法与从图片1中提取的所有风格和环境细节相结合。确保语句流畅，且不改变图片1原有的风格含义)\"\\\n}\\_ ", "", 0.6, 1874026279, "randomize", 6000, 1, 0, 0, "none", false], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 39, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "link": 40, "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "api_config", "label": "api_config", "type": "RH_OPENAPI_CONFIG", "localized_name": "api_config"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized