 textures and exposed brick at the bottom edge of the red wall.\",\n  \"lighting_shadows\": \"Soft, diffused natural lighting typical of an overcast rainy day, creating subtle reflections on the wet ground and soft shadows on the wall.\",\n  \"camera_angle\": \"Wide shot, profile angle, eye-level perspective, deep depth of field keeping both the subject and the textured wall in focus.\",\n  \"atmosphere_style\": \"Cinematic, moody, elegant, and atmospheric, with a striking contrast between the deep red background and the subject.\",\n  \"final_prompt\": \"Use the [subject] from Image 2. Keep the color and shape unchanged. The subject is walking in profile against a massive, textured, weathered red wall. A narrow strip of wet, reflective stone pavement is at the bottom. Diagonal rain streaks fall across the frame. Soft, diffused overcast lighting creates subtle reflections on the wet ground. Wide shot, eye-level perspective, deep depth of field. Cinematic, moody, elegant atmosphere with striking color contrast.\"\n}\n```"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 38, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [477.1408996582031, 978.0396728515625], "pos": [-265.527099609375, 35.81437683105469], "id": 39, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 6}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "pixaromaGroups": [], "ds": {"offset": [1075.066079722129, 354.7935414862272], "scale": 0.544500000000007}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "图1", "bounding": [-1693.527587890625, -281.1473693847656, 589.7816162109375, 744.2725219726562]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "图2", "bounding": [-1695.1229248046875, 503.3913269042969, 595.5435791015625, 698.5038452148438]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_